# Internal engineering docs — never part of the deployed site.
# QC-TRACKER.md was publicly served at zamborin.com/QC-TRACKER.md until 2026-08-24.
# Nothing at runtime fetches a .md; the only reference is a comment in shared/ads.js.
*.md

# Measuring harnesses — instruments, not the site. Kept in git because several
# of them found bugs nothing else could and they are how a change gets
# re-verified, but they are dev pages and have no business being served:
# tools/portal-build.mjs was already reachable at zamborin.com/tools/, the same
# way QC-TRACKER.md was. They run against the local dev server.
/tools/

# Per-game measuring harnesses, for the same reason as /tools/. They are kept
# in git because they are how a change gets re-verified, but they are
# instruments and not part of the site. ballast/tune-m0.mjs and
# ballast/tune-play.mjs were being served before this line was added.
tune-*.mjs
tune-*.js
